@eleswarapu I don't have active positions in $SNDK or Kioxia, but I did see a lot of people panicking unfortunately. 

So I'm just providing nuances regarding GPU bottlenecks and spot market volatility that markets might have overreacted to regarding pricing/demand collapse fears. 

The pair's contract visibility and likely share buybacks over next year or two look pretty compelling if they hold, but lot of uncertainty in markets right now.

